{
    "title": "Night Mode: Photo & Video",
    "description": "Night Mode Camera takes real pictures and videos at the lowest luminosity without any additional appliances. It utilizes a technology developed for years that uses all the computing and hardware abilities of your phone to produce the desired effect. Night Mode Camera works without any delays and lags. During the photo capturing and video recording process you can dynamically change camera sensitivity to achieve your desired result as well as set any 1-8x zoom simultaneous to the recording. The application has its own photo and video library to save, organize and keep photos and videos, and share them on social media.\r\n\r\n* Please note that this is not a true night vision or thermal camera tool. The app functions within the potential and capacity of your phone and phone's camera.",
